@FinPath_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5077

### Регистрация пользователя

POST {{FinPath_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "1@example.com",
  "displayName": "Yevgeniy",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### Вход пользователя

POST {{FinPath_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "1@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

